# Scene2-4-b4

; ========================================
; ●シーン2-4-b4
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:7_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:（……我要杀了艾玛）|#0204Bad04_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个念头在脑海中成型的瞬间。<br>犹豫不决的心，仿佛终于找到了方向。|#0204Bad04_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_32_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她啊，<br>总有一天会成为带来灾祸的魔女哦。|#0204Bad04_Yuki001| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她会杀死很多人。|#0204Bad04_Yuki002| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:会让大家变得不幸。|#0204Bad04_Yuki003| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我回想起小雪<br>曾说过的话。|#0204Bad04_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:小雪是因为遭受霸凌而自杀的。|#0204Bad04_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛选择做个旁观者，<br>不去保护受霸凌的小雪，甚至对这一切视而不见。|#0204Bad04_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这恐怕才是樱羽艾玛的本性。|#0204Bad04_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她就是给世界带来灾祸的，邪恶魔女。|#0204Bad04_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她在这座监牢里的暴露出的可疑举动和诡异言辞，<br>正印证了这一点。|#0204Bad04_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（所以，我要杀了艾玛）|#0204Bad04_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不，我必须杀了艾玛。<br>这是对世界来说最正确的选择。|#0204Bad04_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我伸出手，<br>握住艾玛纤细的脖颈。<br>接着，手指慢慢施力。|#0204Bad04_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 首を絞める音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_153 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:指尖传来仿佛轻轻一折<br>就会断裂的脆弱感。|#0204Bad04_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——和艾玛共度的童年时光。|#0204Bad04_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——小雪、艾玛，还有我。<br>三人一起度过的日子。|#0204Bad04_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——在这座监牢中发生的一切。|#0204Bad04_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:与艾玛有关的回忆，<br>在脑海中不断旋转。|#0204Bad04_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我感到窒息般的痛苦。<br>可勒住她脖子的明明是我。|#0204Bad04_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆首を絞められて

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……啊……|#0204Bad04_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛呻吟着睁开眼。<br>看见是我，她的眼中浮现出惊恐与困惑。|#0204Bad04_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——别被她欺骗。|#0204Bad04_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我加重了手上的力道。|#0204Bad04_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 首を絞める音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_153 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

; ＠備考◆首を絞められて

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……咕……呃！|#0204Bad04_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛手脚并用地挣扎着，试图抵抗。|#0204Bad04_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:去死！去死去死去死！去死……！|#0204Bad04_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:长久以来压抑心底的怨恨喷涌而出。<br>我一刻也没有放松指尖的力道。|#0204Bad04_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于——|#0204Bad04_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:1 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,Angle01/ArmR>ArmR06
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛彻底不动了。<br>像一滩烂泥倒在那里。|#0204Bad04_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊……哈啊……死了……|#0204Bad04_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是我，杀死了，艾玛。|#0204Bad04_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这明明是正确的行动。<br>可不知为何，心情却如此沉重。|#0204Bad04_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一股纷乱的情绪，<br>侵蚀着我的内心。|#0204Bad04_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是罪恶感吗？|#0204Bad04_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不知道。|#0204Bad04_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我说不清自己的感受。|#0204Bad04_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只想快速离开这里。|#0204Bad04_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我松开扼住艾玛脖子的手，向后退开一步。|#0204Bad04_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@StopBgm
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:——为什么？|#0204Bad04_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:！？|#0204Bad04_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的心脏猛地一跳。|#0204Bad04_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本以为已经死去的艾玛，竟然开口说话了。|#0204Bad04_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好过分啊，希罗。|#0204Bad04_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.5 Duration:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1
@Wait WaitMode:2

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛缓缓撑起上半身。<br>她声音昏暗，充斥着一种异样的气息。|#0204Bad04_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛身上的气场让我不由自主地后退了一步。|#0204Bad04_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Duration:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,60 IdAndAppearance:Ema

[PrintTextModified Text:我还以为，我们又能和好了。|#0204Bad04_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走下床，<br>向我逼近。|#0204Bad04_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:CreatureEma.0-1

; ========================================
; 立ち絵：エマ半クリーチャーでお願いします。
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_16_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_16_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:她的身姿扭曲变形，逐渐变成怪物。|#0204Bad04_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女化了吗……？|#0204Bad04_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对步步逼近的艾玛，<br>我感到了深不见底的恐惧。|#0204Bad04_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:化为异形的艾玛纤弱而虚幻，<br>却又透着某种美感，甚至有些神圣。|#0204Bad04_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但同时，我也感到了丑陋。<br>一定是因为她身上<br>孕育着不可名状的邪恶。|#0204Bad04_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我没有错）|#0204Bad04_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛果然是带来灾厄的魔女。|#0204Bad04_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——真的吗？|#0204Bad04_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:事到如今，我的心依然在迷惘。<br>思绪混乱不堪，始终无法坚定。|#0204Bad04_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:究竟什么才是正确的。|#0204Bad04_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我到底应该怎么做？|#0204Bad04_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:CreatureEma.1-1

[PrintTextModified Text:我……想起来了……<br>关于她的事，和我的罪……|#0204Bad04_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她其实，一直都在我身边哦。|#0204Bad04_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你在说什么……？|#0204Bad04_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的视线无法聚焦，<br>在空中游移不定。|#0204Bad04_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她总是在我耳边说……|#0204Bad04_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……说，大家都去死就好了。<br>所以啊……|#0204Bad04_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛飘忽不定的眼神锁定了我。|#0204Bad04_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗你也去死吧？|#0204Bad04_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你说什——|#0204Bad04_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:5 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,0 IdAndAppearance:CreatureEma.1-1
