@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_19 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:如同断线木偶，<br>希罗当场瘫倒下去。|#0204Bad04_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:二阶堂希罗死了。|#0204Bad04_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因觉醒后的艾玛施展出【魔女杀手】魔法，<br>希罗没能发动死亡回溯，而是迎来了真正的死亡。|#0204Bad04_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛茫然伫立在希罗的尸骸前。<br>一个声音在艾玛耳边轻柔地低语道：|#0204Bad04_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:——我们还要杀很多很多人哦，艾玛。|#0204Bad04_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

